use pixi python
use sonarqube_mcp

# PGHOST, PGPORT, PGUSER, PGDATABASE, UVICORN_PORT and EXPENSE_DATA_DIR. Nothing else
# loads them: the app reads the environment and opens no file of its own, poe declares no
# `envfile`, and in CI setup-direnv forwards whatever this line produces.
dotenv_if_exists backend/.env

# Per-machine overrides, layered on top of the defaults above so a value that names a
# place rather than the project - EXPENSE_DATA_DIR - can be redirected without editing a
# tracked file. Absent on most machines, which is why this is `_if_exists`. Matches the
# `.env*` rule in .gitignore, and is not among the two names negated back in there.
dotenv_if_exists backend/.env.local
